    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Where to go next</p>\n    <h2 style=\"max-width:70%\">A5 Character Creation &middot; A5.1 Reading Your Character Sheet &middot; A8 Finding and Joining a Table</h2>\n    <p class=\"body\">That is the whole of it. Questions for as long as you want them.</p>"
