   {
    "label": "System swap table",
    "note": "Reference, not part of the run. Jump here only if somebody asks about a system that is not 5E. One sentence, then route to B30.",
    "cls": "",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Reference, for the teacher</p>\n    <div class=\"fill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What changes if the table plays something other than 5E\"><text x=\"36\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\" letter-spacing=\"3\">IF YOUR TABLE PLAYS SOMETHING ELSE</text><path d=\"M36 80 H1164\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">The loop</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\">Unchanged. Every system has it.</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">Say what you want to happen</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\">Unchanged.</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">The d20</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\">Some systems use pools of d6s, or 2d6, or cards.</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">Add your modifier</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\">Unchanged in nearly all of them.</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"328\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">A target only the GM knows</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"328\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\">Some show you the number. Some have no number.</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"378\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">Advantage and disadvantage</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"378\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\">Named differently, or absent.</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"455\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">One sentence, then carry on. B30 is the class that actually answers this.</text></svg></div>"
   }
