    "note": "Subject 4, D. Say all three, then ask the room for a fourth. Specificity tends to beat volume.",
    "cls": "center",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Three more of them</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"max-width:82%;text-align:center\">A clean room in a ruin.<br>A warm cup in an empty house.<br>A door that was locked from this side.</p><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:1.8em\">Specificity tends to beat volume.</p>"
