    "label": "Tone",
    "note": "Subject 5, 10 min, D, T chimes in. The laugh line is the useful one: if you have not decided the tone, your players will, and they will decide it is comedy.",
    "cls": "",
    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Tone is a decision, not a mood</p><div class=\"fill\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A decided tone holds its line; an undecided tone drifts toward comedy\"><text x=\"70\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"27\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\" letter-spacing=\"3\">DECIDED BEFOREHAND</text><path d=\"M70 120 H920\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M912 110 l14 10 -14 10\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"952\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"30\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\">holds</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"247\" font-size=\"27\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#4a453a\" letter-spacing=\"3\">NOT DECIDED</text><path d=\"M70 300 C210 300 250 318 370 322 C500 327 530 368 660 356 C780 345 800 306 920 310\" stroke=\"#4a453a\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"10 9\"/><path d=\"M912 300 l14 10 -14 10\" stroke=\"#4a453a\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"952\" y=\"280\" width=\"186\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16140f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1045\" y=\"321\" font-size=\"30\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">comedy</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"443\" font-size=\"28\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" fill=\"#16140f\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\">Tone is carried by what you choose to describe, not by adjectives.</text></svg></div>"
