    "html": "<p class=\"kicker\">Live: prep this, on the sheet, ten minutes</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"max-width:80%;text-align:center\">A village has stopped sending its tithe to the abbey. The abbot wants to know why, and wants it quiet.</p><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:1.8em\">Six boxes. Forty minutes is the real limit. Ten is the one you have.</p>"
